lens:
CRO (Baymard/CXL school, D2C jewellery India), round 4. Measures add-to-cart and checkout rate for a shopper landing from an Instagram ad at 360x640 in the in-app browser: first-screen decision content, the buy path (Add to bag, Buy now, sticky bar, the moment after adding), the 20% add-to-checkout drop, the Buy 2/3/4 ladder and AOV, COD vs prepaid, ad message match, friction and distraction, and the test plan.

G3 passes. fold.png, added.png, fold-ad.png, screens_1–3.jpg and measure.json (04:30) are newer than prototype.html (04:28:28) and match it. fold-ad.png is byte-identical to fold.png (md5 ab13225d…), by design.

Behaviour was probed on an untouched copy (md5 49edcb03…) in /tmp/claude-0/-home-user/aaed4e78-f5ea-57f6-bb8a-ea8f2c0ecee0/scratchpad/cro_r4/:
- probe.js and probe.json: the buy path, bag geometry, double taps, Buy now, landings, folds at four sizes;
- probe2.js and probe2.json: card mode for an add at every 50px of scroll;
- probe3.json: copy fits; probe4.json: card mode for small scrolls; probe5.js: the compact-card mock;
- screenshots: bag1.png, bag2.png, bag4.png, card_ring.png, dock2400.png, add_at_300_950ms.png, add_at_450_950ms.png, card_compact_y60.png, mock_compact_size_y60.png, var_add_at_300_950ms.png;
- var/prototype.html (built by mkvar.py) and var_probe2.json: the fix-2 variant.
The prototype was not edited.

All eight of my R3 fixes landed and work: the bag's checkout is guarded, the COD figure sits above it, the bar reads 'Bag & checkout', the one-piece bag offers the ring, the set ticks are inert, the bar stays on to the footer, and the bag is instrumented. Two R3 changes now work against the moment after adding at 360x640. From a 20px scroll the compact card hides the ring's size line, which undoes my R3 fix. And the 'no dock over the set' rule leaves an add at scrollY 200–500 with no card at all. score_now is the weighted mean of the same 14 criteria as R3: 670.1 / 76 = 8.82, reported as 8.8. The critique is also saved to /tmp/claude-0/-home-user/aaed4e78-f5ea-57f6-bb8a-ea8f2c0ecee0/scratchpad/pdp10/rounds/r4_cro.json.

